      "message": "scripted-diff: Remove trailing newlines from one-line log messages\n\nThe replacement skips log messages that contain: \" or \\\nThis keeps the script simple and allows to handle the special cases\nmanually.\n\n-BEGIN VERIFY SCRIPT-\n\n sed --in-place --regexp-extended 's/(Log(Debug|Error|Info|Trace|Warning)\\([^\"]*\"[^\"\\\\]*)\\\\n\"([,)])/\\1\"\\3/g' $(\n     git grep -l --extended-regexp 'Log(Debug|Error|Info|Trace|Warning)\\(' ./src\n )\n\n-END VERIFY SCRIPT-",
      "committer": {
        "name": "MarcoFalke",
        "email": "*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz",
        "date": "2026-11-17T20:49:21Z"
      },
