      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36904\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36904.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36904#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36906](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36906) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36906.svg\"></sub> (Detect transaction problems early during deserialization by sipa)\n* [#36897](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36897) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36897.svg\"></sub> (wallet, migration: Contain all legacy wallet and migration related things in its own subdirectory, namespace, and classes by achow101)\n* [#36894](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36894) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36894.svg\"></sub> (net_processing: set fDisconnect instead of calling DisconnectNode by Crypt-iQ)\n* [#36858](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36858) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36858.svg\"></sub> (refactor: break the blockstorage/validation circular dependency by pzafonte)\n* [#36856](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36856) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36856.svg\"></sub> (kernel: add manual pruning by pzafonte)\n* [#36820](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36820) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36820.svg\"></sub> (refactor: remove more dead code by fanquake)\n* [#36787](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36787) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36787.svg\"></sub> (cmpctblock: Cache serialized cmpctblock msg for relay [part of prefill series] by davidgumberg)\n* [#36738](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36738) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36738.svg\"></sub> (refactor: move block writes and pruning into BlockManager by pzafonte)\n* [#36675](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36675) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36675.svg\"></sub> (bugfix: send shortened IPv6 addresses to SOCKS5 proxies in full by instagibbs)\n* [#36598](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36598) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36598.svg\"></sub> ([Demo] validation: remove AssumeUTXO by l0rinc)\n* [#36586](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36586) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36586.svg\"></sub> (coins: warn of low disk space before chainstate compaction by l0rinc)\n* [#36540](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36540) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36540.svg\"></sub> (mempool: remove time-based transaction expiry by ismaelsadeeq)\n* [#36434](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36434) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36434.svg\"></sub> (http: support unix sockets by pinheadmz)\n* [#36326](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36326) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36326.svg\"></sub> (kernel: Use typed errors for fatal and flush error notifications by arejula27)\n* [#36015](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36015) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36015.svg\"></sub> (txorphanage: bound orphan memory by storing transactions serialized by brunoerg)\n* [#35998](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35998) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35998.svg\"></sub> (wallet: Handle or explicitly ignore `WalletBatch` write failures by achow101)\n* [#35906](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35906) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35906.svg\"></sub> (First steps towards a stateless, side-effect free validation library by purpleKarrot)\n* [#35902](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35902) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35902.svg\"></sub> (zmq: Log bind error at Error level, abort startup on init error by chriszeng1010)\n* [#35570](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35570) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35570.svg\"></sub> (refactor: Change some validation.cpp methods to return BlockValidationState by optout21)\n* [#35558](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35558) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35558.svg\"></sub> (p2p: Prefill compact blocks by davidgumberg)\n* [#35522](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35522) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35522.svg\"></sub> (refactor: Extract per-message helpers from SendMessages() (move-only) by pablomartin4btc)\n* [#35502](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35502) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35502.svg\"></sub> (refactor: extract per-message helpers from ProcessMessage (move-only) by w0xlt)\n* [#35355](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35355) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35355.svg\"></sub> (Use atomics for determining whether trace logging is enabled by ajtowns)\n* [#35354](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35354) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35354.svg\"></sub> (net: defer compact filter requests that race the filter index by randomlogin)\n* [#35229](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35229) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35229.svg\"></sub> (refactor: Use CBlockIndex parameters as reference by optout21)\n* [#34909](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34909) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34909.svg\"></sub> (wallet, refactor: modularise wallet by extracting out legacy wallet migration by rkrux)\n* [#34778](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34778) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34778.svg\"></sub> (logging: rewrite macros to enforce restrictions at compile-time, improve efficiency and usability by ryanofsky)\n* [#34400](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34400) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34400.svg\"></sub> (wallet: parallel fast rescan by Eunovo)\n* [#34038](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34038) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34038.svg\"></sub> (logging: replace -loglevel with -trace, expose trace logging via RPC by ajtowns)\n* [#33324](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33324) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/33324.svg\"></sub> (blocks: add resumable reobfuscation for existing block files by l0rinc)\n* [#31260](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/31260) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/31260.svg\"></sub> (scripted-diff: Type-safe settings retrieval by ryanofsky)\n* [#30951](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/30951) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/30951.svg\"></sub> (net: option to disallow v1 connection on ipv4 and ipv6 peers by stratospher)\n* [#30343](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/30343) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/30343.svg\"></sub> (wallet, logging: Replace WalletLogPrintf() with LogInfo() by ryanofsky)\n* [#29256](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/29256) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/29256.svg\"></sub> (log, refactor: Allow log macros to accept context arguments by ryanofsky)\n* [#26022](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/26022) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/26022.svg\"></sub> (Add util::ResultPtr class by ryanofsky)\n* [#25665](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/25665) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/25665.svg\"></sub> (refactor: Add util::Result failure types and ability to merge result values by ryanofsky)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->\n### LLM Linter (✨ experimental)\n\n\n\nPossible typos and grammar issues:\n\n- `src/policy/fees/block_policy_estimator.cpp`: `mempool tx removed from >25 blocks,bucketIndex=%u already` → `mempool tx older than 25 blocks removed, but bucketIndex=%u is already zero` [the original phrasing obscures what happened]\n- `src/policy/fees/block_policy_estimator.cpp`: `mempool tx removed from blockIndex=%u,bucketIndex=%u already` → `mempool tx removed from blockIndex=%u, but bucketIndex=%u is already zero` [the original phrasing obscures what happened]\n\n\n\n<sup>2026-11-17 21:01:41</sup>\n",
